  "note": "½log|τ/2| + 0.609/|τ| ≤ ½log|τ| − 0.3222 for |τ| ≥ 25, so −0.297 leaves 0.025 of slack; the dropped imaginary part costs at most (Im ψ/2)²/(2(log x + ½log 12.5)) ≤ 0.017 for x ≥ 10⁸. Erratum: The second line of (9.88) prints e^{−π|τ|/2}, but (9.87) at w = s/2+1 (|Im w| = |τ|/2) gives e^{−π|τ|/4}: at s = 100i, x = 10⁸, |F_x(s)| = 2.81·10⁻³² against the printed 1.57·10⁻⁶⁵. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_9_88.py`)."
